        "TileImage": "$($repository af1e2d72-ddb1-4dfd-a911-ca13a094a8d8).Image",
        "Description": "Mornin&apos;\rWe finally got clearance to engage on the Delgado mansion after a successfull espionage proved the export and production of cocain, a team is ready to secure the field outside the mansion, but first we need the head of the serpent to be cut from the equation to cause panic within the cartel.\r\rThat&apos;s where you come in, you&apos;ve been tasked with taking out the leader, Rico Delgado, and some important figures.\r\rAdditionaly, bring back a brick of cocain for analysis.\rGood luck soldier.\r\r-&amp;#*£@",
